{"content":[{"c":["SO"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["A king of Egypt, mentioned once in Scripture (",{"href":"?bref=2Kgs.17.4","r":"2Kgs.17.4","rawR":"2Kgs.17.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Kgs.17.4","value":"2Kgs.17.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Kgs 17:4"},"), with whom Hoshea, king of Israel, sought an alliance. This rebellious move, in part, prompted Shalmaneser V of Assyria to imprison Hoshea (",{"href":"?bref=2Kgs.17.3-5","r":"2Kgs.17.3-5","rawR":"2Kgs.17.3-5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Kgs.17.3-5","value":"2Kgs.17.3-5"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Kgs 17:3-5"},"). It is difficult to identify So with any of the rulers of Egypt who are named in extrabiblical sources."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"So","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"2 Kgs 17:4","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Kgs.17.4","rawQueryValue":"2Kgs.17.4","sourceRefExact":"2Kgs.17.4"},{"anchorText":"2 Kgs 17:3-5","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Kgs.17.3-5","rawQueryValue":"2Kgs.17.3-5","sourceRefExact":"2Kgs.17.3-5"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"bff9b8610f6dee7e8c4027df4597319af691c2b48f219e9a9658f7aa1b57c1ac","sourceItemName":"So","sourceItemOrder":475,"sourceMember":"Articles/S.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"So","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"So","title":"So","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}